## Validation Coverage:

The implementation validates:
- Top-level keys (id, portrait, entries)
- Id matching filename
- Portrait path existence (res://)
- Entries array (1–64 items, unique ids)
- Priority bounds (0–100)
- Line/choice text length caps
- Goto target resolution
- Condition language (composites: all/any/not; 10 leaf operators)
- Condition depth (max 8, prevents circular/infinite nesting)
- Flag declarations (all named flags must be in flags.json)
- on_end currencies (gold, ore, echo_shards only)

